# Panel

`features/` UI+hooks · `shared/` UI/auth/api · `providers/` router/query/redux(UI) · `services/` HTTP · `pages/` ince.

## State / auth
- Server → React Query; auth → `authStore` + `useAuth`; Redux yalnız UI (auth/user yok)
- Access: memory only; refresh: HttpOnly cookie + `withCredentials`; user persist yok → `/auth/me`
- `rememberMe` → `remember_me` (kalıcı vs session cookie)
- Boot: `bootstrapSession` → cookie refresh → access → `fetchUser` (`initialLoading`)
- Guard: `requireRoles` (loading early-return yok); logout: memory + `queryClient.clear` + `/login`; bridge: `auth-bridge`
- Refresh: `POST /auth/refresh` credentials; body’de refresh yok; catch’te `error.message`

## Router
- `createRouter` bir kez (module); `RouterProvider context={{ user }}`; `routes.config` + factory + `requireRoles`
- Roller: `user` | `admin` (admin bypass). Router’ı render’da yeniden yaratma; empty catch’e yorum koy
